      "id": 493009,
      "username": "sharpec",
      "name": "EnzoC",
      "created_at": "2026-01-31T15:56:12.442Z",
      "cooked": "<p>To do this directly on your site, log in to Crowdin and then, in the same browser, access ERPNext. Go to your User Settings and set the language to <strong>“eo”</strong> (In-context translation). This will activate an overlay on the UI labels, allowing you to translate “Work Order” and see it immediately. Once submitted, the translation will be reviewed and approved; within a few days, it will be synchronized across all versions.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/a/7ab86c0a619e6c2a22468bb798e52db8231f4492.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/7ab86c0a619e6c2a22468bb798e52db8231f4492\" title=\"Screenshot_2026-01-31_16-53-03\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/a/7ab86c0a619e6c2a22468bb798e52db8231f4492.png\" alt=\"Screenshot_2026-01-31_16-53-03\" data-base62-sha1=\"hvDnaO1axAlaVFZVoUbTO3tkO42\" width=\"392\" height=\"246\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot_2026-01-31_16-53-03</span><span class=\"informations\">392×246 8.26 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
