      "name": "Alessandro",
      "created_at": "2026-02-02T10:33:43.861Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I have a doubt, this work only on cloud installation? Because I have a local machine installed in developer mode at moment.</p>\n<p>I attach the screenshot of what I did, but at moment doesn’t work.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/5/6510a3d1f2941f9715776206fcf634ce3d35f000.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/6510a3d1f2941f9715776206fcf634ce3d35f000\" title=\"erp_translate\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/5/6510a3d1f2941f9715776206fcf634ce3d35f000_2_690x437.png\" alt=\"erp_translate\" data-base62-sha1=\"eq3SgYCNUAcXog5GSSuL6BauVJC\" width=\"690\" height=\"437\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/5/6510a3d1f2941f9715776206fcf634ce3d35f000_2_690x437.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/5/6510a3d1f2941f9715776206fcf634ce3d35f000_2_1035x655.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/5/6510a3d1f2941f9715776206fcf634ce3d35f000.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F9F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">erp_translate</span><span class=\"informations\">1329×843 29.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/8/a87462f89ef20f8ec662892a884fe1f8930acd4b.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/a87462f89ef20f8ec662892a884fe1f8930acd4b\" title=\"erp2\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/8/a87462f89ef20f8ec662892a884fe1f8930acd4b_2_690x409.png\" alt=\"erp2\" data-base62-sha1=\"o2dztuGqwvwKnawgMDD25DJOqtZ\" width=\"690\" he